gu (pula).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَٱرْتَقِبْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/6722599185daeffc38d1.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "zato iščekuj", "en": "so watch and wait", "tr": "bu yüzden bekle", "fr": "alors guette et attends", "id": "maka tunggulah dan amatilah", "ur": "پس تو انتظار کر", "bn": "অতএব অপেক্ষায় থাকো", "fa": "پس چشم‌به‌راه باش"}}, {"text": "إِنَّهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّرْتَقِبُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "فَٱرْتَقِبْ", "count": 2, "first": "44:10", "audio": "audio/08f4cbceca917184ca90.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "zato iščekuj", "en": "so watch and wait", "tr": "böylece gözetle ve bekle", "fr": "alors guette donc", "id": "maka awasilah dan tunggulah!", "ur": "پس انتظار کرو!", "bn": "অতএব অপেক্ষা কর", "fa": "پس انتظار بکش"}}, {"arabic": "وَٱرْتَقِبُوٓا۟", "count": 1, "first": "11:93", "audio": "audio/d45dafe8cb57e74dc29a.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "and (you all) watch!", "bs": "i iščekujte!", "tr": "ve gözetleyin!", "fr": "et guettez !", "id": "dan awasilah!", "ur": "اور انتظار کرو!", "bn": "এবং অপেক্ষা কর!", "fa": "و انتظار بکشید!"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱرْتَقِبْهُمْ", "count": 1, "first": "54:27", "audio": "audio/67c4b5966b5eb6d2090a.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"]}], "gloss": {"en": "so watch them!", "bs": "pa ih motri!", "tr": "böylece onları gözet!", "fr": "alors veille sur eux !", "id": "maka awasilah mereka!", "ur": "پس ان کی نگرانی کرو!", "bn": "অতএব তাদের পর্যবেক্ষণ কর!", "fa": "پس آنان را زیر نظر بگیر!"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0536.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0536.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0536.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0536.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0536.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "اِ